KZ3 patch 2102 (RSX pass 100): diagnostics for upstream PRs 504, 508 and the plain DEPTH16/X16 binds (LD_FEAT_LOG=1).

[vtx-wrap]: vertex base + array offset at or above 2^28; kind-6 surfmatch rows: texture formats the colour-surface match took; [z16-plain]: guest bytes under a DEPTH16/X16 bind that is not a host zeta.

Rebased on ps3recomp v0.18.0 (SPU pass 108): [vtx-wrap] diagnostic dropped: upstream #504 merged (rsx_dsp_resolve_vertex_offset); rest kept.

diff --git a/libs/video/rsx_live_draw.c b/libs/video/rsx_live_draw.c
